<title>POLAND: PROCHNIK AUG NET FALLS TO PLN 270.000.</title>
<headline>PROCHNIK AUG NET FALLS TO PLN 270.000.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.27 vs   0.30</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.27 vs   0.30</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.44 vs   0.58</p>
<p> Sales		    4.96 vs   5.89</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net loss		 1.63 vs   0.43 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   1.63 vs   0.43 profit</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.44 vs   1.90 profit</p>
<p> Sales		   29.01 vs  30.03</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Prochnik SA. </p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
